SNAHOME V1.1 - README
---------------------

This file is for users of V1.0 who wish to upgrade to V1.1  New users should use the full instructions.

To upgrade from V1.0, replace the old SNAHOME0.APP file with the new SNAHOME1.APP and remove the old OVL files from the \APP\SNAHOME\ directory.

1.    If you are using the optional On-Line Help (Highly recommended) replace the file SNAHOMEH.OVL in the \APP\SNAHOME\ directory.

2.    If you are using the optional Print option replace the file S3AHOMEP.OVL in the \APP\SNAHOME\ directory.

The following enhancements have been added.

a.	Extensively recoded to speed it up.
b.	Export function.
c.	Sort on Room/Category.
d.	'Unknown' date allowed.  (Use 01/01/70)
e.	Three attempts now allowed at the Password.

Hope you like the improvements.

Al
